<title>USA: SatCon acquires Film Microelectronics.</title>
<headline>SatCon acquires Film Microelectronics.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>SatCon Technology Corp said on Thursday that it has completed the acquisition of Film Microelectronics Inc.</p>
<p>The acquisition cost included 420,000 shares of SatCon common stock and the assumption of certain liabilities, SatCon said.</p>
<p>Also, SatCon will pay Film Microelectronics's principal shareholder $500,000 over the next eight months in exchange for a non-competition agreement, the company said.</p>
<p>A manufacturer of custom and integrated electronic circuits, Film Microelectronics's revenues for its most recent fiscal year were approximately $5 million, SatCon said.</p>
</text>
